Selecting the fastest 300 selected for simplicity, so among all 231 eligible
programs only 1 uses char, 2 declare a sum type, 2 a constructed type and 3 a
lambda. Those forms are present here but barely. Widening the pool past the
fast tail is the fix when it matters.

